{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Bound cleanup after a selected suspension or retry.** `invokeHandler` must finish before the selected outcome is consumed, so a blocking handler `finally` can prevent an already-checkpointed `PENDING`/`RETRYING` response until Lambda terminates the invocation. Race cleanup against the Lambda remaining-time budget, reserving time for finalization and response delivery, and add a low-remaining-time test with a blocked `finally`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772Q_I","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":127,"observation_digest":"298644ed08d004d740edb497a1e3e733e0ae674d8a5c621f1a5f3e0b2ba86aa0","observation_id":"aro_v1_fgdej3ii2acnoqhnwsl2dy7hgp","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_szk72x3mjnb5bveole7xlq3ka3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a14e96e22281887b621451a5488a88d7de1a49ff","reviewer":"codex","start_line":127,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_rti5leblf26dcqmxgzmhttchig","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
